    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760710/extras/baa233c8193964c87363db6b75194de2.avif?t=1755710074\" data-has-big width=800 height=426 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get In Timelessness</strong>\u00a0\u2014 is a psychological horror game about hidden nightmares that can only be seen by accident. The story that unfolds here tells about a man and his fate to face the  unthinkable, to go through horror, to sink to the very bottom of the impossible.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760710/extras/f8d21f8cbb82d3a3fd33e9741edcbfbf.poster.avif?t=1755710074\" width=602 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760710/extras/f8d21f8cbb82d3a3fd33e9741edcbfbf.webm?t=1755710074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760710/extras/f8d21f8cbb82d3a3fd33e9741edcbfbf.mp4?t=1755710074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The main character of this story is Calib</strong>, a twenty\u2014five-year-old guy from Tennessee, an office worker and an exemplary husband... But all this was crossed out by one tragic event: his wife, Ellie, died in a car accident.<br><br>Unable to cope with the pain of loss, Calib tried to find salvation in alcoholic oblivion. So began his aimless wanderings through the bars of the city, hoping to numb the pain a little and learn to live with it.<br>And this path led him to the doors of the &quot;Star Light&quot; bar. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760710/extras/33c0a02094682dfe1dc6015cc2a1eaa9.poster.avif?t=1755710074\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760710/extras/33c0a02094682dfe1dc6015cc2a1eaa9.webm?t=1755710074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760710/extras/33c0a02094682dfe1dc6015cc2a1eaa9.mp4?t=1755710074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Is Calib story defined by one outcome, or does it have other endings?</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760710/extras/8aebbacb4f1fbd8060881cae6643ec1c.poster.avif?t=1755710074\" width=357 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760710/extras/8aebbacb4f1fbd8060881cae6643ec1c.webm?t=1755710074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong>                                                       </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >      The main character of the game is not a hero or a villain. This is an ordinary man whose life has gone downhill. Trying to make sense of his loss, he is faced with something that goes beyond the norm;               </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >       Explore 2D locations and uncover alternate endings by interacting with the world in different ways \u2014 you may find that Calib's story doesn\u2019t always end the same way;                       </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >       The game's story is based on the author's original universe and the short story &quot;Get in Timelessness.&quot; This is the first step towards other stories that are waiting in the wings on the other side of the ink.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760710/extras/baa233c8193964c87363db6b75194de2.avif?t=1755710074\" data-has-big width=800 height=426 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get In Timelessness</strong>\u00a0\u2014 is a psychological horror game about hidden nightmares that can only be seen by accident. The story that unfolds here tells about a man and his fate to face the  unthinkable, to go through horror, to sink to the very bottom of the impossible.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760710/extras/f8d21f8cbb82d3a3fd33e9741edcbfbf.poster.avif?t=1755710074\" width=602 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760710/extras/f8d21f8cbb82d3a3fd33e9741edcbfbf.webm?t=1755710074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760710/extras/f8d21f8cbb82d3a3fd33e9741edcbfbf.mp4?t=1755710074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The main character of this story is Calib</strong>, a twenty\u2014five-year-old guy from Tennessee, an office worker and an exemplary husband... But all this was crossed out by one tragic event: his wife, Ellie, died in a car accident.<br><br>Unable to cope with the pain of loss, Calib tried to find salvation in alcoholic oblivion. So began his aimless wanderings through the bars of the city, hoping to numb the pain a little and learn to live with it.<br>And this path led him to the doors of the &quot;Star Light&quot; bar. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760710/extras/33c0a02094682dfe1dc6015cc2a1eaa9.poster.avif?t=1755710074\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760710/extras/33c0a02094682dfe1dc6015cc2a1eaa9.webm?t=1755710074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760710/extras/33c0a02094682dfe1dc6015cc2a1eaa9.mp4?t=1755710074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Is Calib story defined by one outcome, or does it have other endings?</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760710/extras/8aebbacb4f1fbd8060881cae6643ec1c.poster.avif?t=1755710074\" width=357 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760710/extras/8aebbacb4f1fbd8060881cae6643ec1c.webm?t=1755710074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong>                                                       </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >      The main character of the game is not a hero or a villain. This is an ordinary man whose life has gone downhill. Trying to make sense of his loss, he is faced with something that goes beyond the norm;               </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >       Explore 2D locations and uncover alternate endings by interacting with the world in different ways \u2014 you may find that Calib's story doesn\u2019t always end the same way;                       </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >       The game's story is based on the author's original universe and the short story &quot;Get in Timelessness.&quot; This is the first step towards other stories that are waiting in the wings on the other side of the ink.</p>",
    "short_description": "A psychological horror about a man who, by the will of fate \u2014 or a joke of chance \u2014 had to face the unthinkable. Sometimes a person looks into the abyss. Sometimes the abyss looks at you. And sometimes... She turns out to be Hungry.",
