        ],
        "notes": "There is no sexual content in the game at all (no BDSM, no hints, nothing). Except that a light flirtation with the barmaid can be considered similar content.\r\n\r\nThe game has a depressing, gloomy atmosphere at some points.\r\n\r\nThere is cruelty shown to the main character and scenes with his deaths (there will be a little more such deaths in the future).\r\n\r\nDrug use is also mentioned, but it is not idealized. There is no obvious inclination to such a thing, the position of the the main character is sharply the opposite of this.\r\n\r\nThe topic of alcohol is often raised, and smoking is rarely mentioned. Towards the end of the game, the main character is less willing to deal with alcoholic beverages."
    },
